cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Mnemosyne in research, please cite the software release you used."
type: software
title: "Mnemosyne: local-first, long-term memory for AI agents"
abstract: >-
  Mnemosyne (npm package mnemosy-ai) is a local-first memory engine for AI agents.
  One SQLite file keeps what an agent learned together with the evidence it came
  from and serves it over TypeScript, MCP, CLI and HTTP. When a source is
  corrected, memories recorded as depending on it are retired.
